      <h2 class="h2" id="factory-h2">75,000 Sq Ft Garment Factory — Dhaka, Bangladesh</h2>
      <p class="lead">Every stage of garment production under one roof. No subcontracting, no split production, no handoffs between buildings that create quality gaps. What we say happens in-house actually happens in-house.</p>
      <div class="g2" style="margin-top:1.4rem;">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="h3">🏭 The Facility</div>
          <p class="body">Our 75,000 sq ft purpose-built factory in Dhaka runs separate production lines for knitwear, woven apparel, and outerwear — each with its own dedicated supervisors, in-line quality controllers, and fabric store. Keeping categories separate prevents cross-contamination and lets us run concurrent production across different product types without one affecting another. We sit within direct logistics reach of Chittagong port for FOB ocean freight and Dhaka airport for DHL Express samples and air freight.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="h3">🔬 Quality Control</div>
          <p class="body">ISO 9001 certified quality management with four defined checkpoints — 4-point fabric inspection before cutting, cut-panel audit, in-line sewing check every 50th piece, and AQL 2.5 final inspection of packed cartons before anything is approved for shipment. Third-party inspection available from SGS, Bureau Veritas, or Intertek at buyer cost. Spectrophotometer colour matching for dye-lot consistency across production runs.</p>
        </div>
