  <section class="sec" aria-labelledby="founder-h2">
    <div class="c">
      <span class="eye">Our Purpose</span>
      <h2 class="h2" id="founder-h2" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:1.4rem;">Founder's Vision</h2>
      <div class="fq-box">
        <p class="fq-text">"When we started SDF Clothing in 1998, the goal was not to be the cheapest garment factory in Bangladesh. It was to be the most trustworthy. We believed — and still believe — that a Bangladesh apparel manufacturer can deliver the same quality as any factory in Europe, with the same ethical standards and the same supply chain transparency. {yearsExp}+ years later, 200+ international brands agree. Every certification, every documented process, every worker trained — all of it serves one purpose: when a brand sources garments from SDF Clothing, they know exactly what they are getting and where it came from."</p>
        <div class="fq-sig">— Chowdhury Remon, Founder &amp; CEO &nbsp;·&nbsp; SDF Clothing &nbsp;·&nbsp; Est. August 22, 1998</div>
